            "bio": "Craig Rachel is a Director in the AlixPartners M&A team, based in London. \n\nCraig’s career is focused on consumer M&A, particularly in transactions in the restaurant, pub and bar sectors. Notable transactions he has advised on include: \n\n-\tthe of Pho restaurants to TriSpan Rising Stars; \n-\tthe sale of the Big Table Group to Epiris;  \n-\tgrowth capital investment by Imbiba into Vagabond Wines; \n-\tthe sale of the New World Trading Company to Graphite Capital; and\n-\tthe sale of various hospitality assets of the Thomas Cook Group\n\nHe has spent the last ten years advising investors and corporate boards on a variety of strategic projects, from sales of businesses, to raising equity capital, refinancing, strategic options and advice on buy-side acquisitions. \n",
