            "bio": "A Dutch national & a global citizen with 17+ years of working experience in international business, media & marketing. A serial entrepreneur with a passion for connecting people.\n\nDefined by her perseverance and international expansion drift, she travelled and worked around the world and opened her own offices in Europe, the Middle East & Africa.\n\nWelcome to the World is an inspirational video platform positioned as a new benchmark in international tourism recovery. It launched a revolutionary new approach, disrupting the standard travel and leisure booking norms by giving travelers the opportunity to use a direct booking option. The new method supports local businesses that were heavily affected by the global corona crisis, allowing more tourism dirhams to be spend in the destination, instead of on online aggregators.\n\nFounder & Managing Partner\nGlobally FZ-LLC\n\nGlobally is a sustainability driven company connecting innovations globally and mobilizing stakeholders to act together in realizing positive change. Globally is home to the innovative video sharing platform Globally Great that is mobilizing impactful solutions - on a global scale. \n\nFounder & Managing Director\nCityFilm Media Consultancy LLC\n\nCityFilm produces innovative media products & channels to support local destination marketing strategies. \n\nChairman\nNetherlands Business Council UAE\n\nThe NBC connects people and knowledge, for the benefit of its members. The council supports and represents the business interest of the Netherlands Business Community in the UAE.",
